    "srcM": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-rRdrQBg/0/NWrcRpzXrbMcgcmP48CHjZh7PHDj3RZPh3rTtNqkK/L/_WHO1570-Pano-Edit-Edit-L.jpg",
